This branch contains a forward-port of the kernel/core portions of #49887 plus the prefix-caching prototype. It must be rebased and split after the ReplaySSM dependency settles.

## Summary

This prototype enables prefix caching for ReplaySSM speculative decoding with an in-model MTP drafter on hybrid GDN models, including the Qwen3.5/Qwen3.6 family.

Main pieces:

- extend the aligned hybrid cache layout for the ReplaySSM checkpoint and input ring;
- materialize and restore GDN recurrent state at prefix-cache boundaries;
- keep ReplaySSM metadata and cursors consistent across cache hits, block reuse and preemption;
- route fu

## Summary

Adds a default-off, user-controlled ROCm multi-stream path for DeepSeek V4 C4 decode/target verification:

- main stream: normal Q/K preparation;
- side stream 0: C4 core compressor;
- side stream 1: C4 indexer compressor;
- join before indexer/attention consumes the compressor outputs.

Enable with `SGLANG_DSV4_ROCM_ATTN_MULTI_STREAM=1`. The model does not infer policy from TP/DP topology, batch size, head count, or benchmark results; it only retains correctness guards for HIP graph capture, C4 compressor availability, decode/verify mode, and prefill CP.

The change also makes split-K scratch stream-local.

## Runtime requirement

Performance requires ROCm 10 plus the device-res
